{"id":"b2cb2118f43b23b3","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-sheaf.md","title":"Sheaf","display":"df-sheaf — Sheaf","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sheaf","aliases":["58-df-sheaf","Sheaf"],"display":"df-sheaf — Sheaf","depends_on":["[[58-df-presheaf]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sheaf</span><span>Sheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sheaf — Sheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8876d83b2589a917\" href=\"?note=8876d83b2589a917\" title=\"58-df-presheaf\">58-df-presheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用内部依赖定义。</li>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(\\mathcal F)\">\\(F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(\\mathcal F)\">\\(F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>；对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq U\">\\(V\\subseteq U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_{V,U}=F_1(\\langle V,U\\rangle)\">\\(r_{V,U}=F_1(\\langle V,U\\rangle)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,A,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rs=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,r,s)\">\\(rs=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,r,s)\\)</span>；所有复合均由公式中的源靶约束。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Locality}_S,\\operatorname{Gluing}_S,\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{Locality}_S,\\operatorname{Gluing}_S,\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}locality}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Locality}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\forall I,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal T)\\land U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathcal U(i))\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(U))\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\in I\\;r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}s=r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}t)\\to s=t\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}locality}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Locality}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\forall I,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal T)\\land U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathcal U(i))\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(U))\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\in I\\;r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}s=r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}t)\\to s=t\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}gluing}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Gluing}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\forall I,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal T)\\land U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathcal U(i))\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)^I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\forall i\\in I\\;(a(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(\\mathcal U(i))))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\nr_{\\mathcal U(i)\\cap\\mathcal U(j),\\mathcal U(i)}a(i)\n=r_{\\mathcal U(i)\\cap\\mathcal U(j),\\mathcal U(j)}a(j)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\to\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(U))\\;\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}s=a(i))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}gluing}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Gluing}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\forall I,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal T)\\land U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathcal U(i))\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)^I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\forall i\\in I\\;(a(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(\\mathcal U(i))))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\nr_{\\mathcal U(i)\\cap\\mathcal U(j),\\mathcal U(i)}a(i)\n=r_{\\mathcal U(i)\\cap\\mathcal U(j),\\mathcal U(j)}a(j)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\to\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(U))\\;\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}s=a(i))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Locality}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Gluing}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Locality}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Gluing}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>以所有 Hom 集中的广义截面表达覆盖锥的泛性质，因此不需要一个未声明的“底层集合”函子。</li>\n<li>在通常的集合值、群值和模值情形，这正是相容局部截面的唯一粘合条件。</li>\n<li>限制箭头来自开集相反范畴；其编码、方向和复合已在前两节明确。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Bott and Tu, Differential Forms in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-presheaf","status":"resolved","id":"8876d83b2589a917","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-presheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"F_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"F_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"r_{V,U}=F_1(\\langle V,U\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"rs=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,r,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Locality}_S,\\operatorname{Gluing}_S,\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}locality}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{Locality}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\forall I,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal T)\\land U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathcal U(i))\\to\\\\\n&\\qquad\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(U))\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\in I\\;r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}s=r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}t)\\to s=t\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}gluing}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{Gluing}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\forall I,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal T)\\land U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathcal U(i))\\to\\\\\n&\\qquad\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)^I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\forall i\\in I\\;(a(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(\\mathcal U(i))))\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\nr_{\\mathcal U(i)\\cap\\mathcal U(j),\\mathcal U(i)}a(i)\n=r_{\\mathcal U(i)\\cap\\mathcal U(j),\\mathcal U(j)}a(j)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\to\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,F_0(U))\\;\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(r_{\\mathcal U(i),U}s=a(i))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Presheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Locality}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\operatorname{Gluing}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C).","display":true}],"bytes":3072,"backlinks":[{"id":"3de4d546216326d8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9466be9df2f5cd8c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9e4036f3b2c8bb56","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal C)$（$\\mathcal C$-值 sheaf 谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-sheaf.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1149","locations":["正文"]